OL,3,GNEWSAFlat fire caused by
OL,4,A'inappropriate' use of electrics
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn investigation into a flat fire in
OL,7,FDerby has concluded that the most
OL,8,Flikely cause was "accidental" and
OL,9,Flinked to the "inappropriate use of
OL,10,Felectrics in the roof space".
OL,12,FDerbyshire Fire and Rescue Service said
OL,13,Fit was called to reports of the fire in
OL,14,FOsmaston Road, Normanton, shortly after
OL,15,F13:40 BST on Thursday.
OL,17,FThe service said crews from Derbyshire
OL,18,Fand Nottinghamshire attended the blaze
OL,19,Fand found a fire affecting both the
OL,20,Ffirst-floor flat and the roof space.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
